OL,3,GNEWSANew primary school opens after
OL,4,Alengthy delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new primary school, originally set to
OL,7,Fopen two years ago but beset by delays,
OL,8,Fwill welcome its first pupils on
OL,9,FMonday.
OL,11,FKingsbourne Academy, on the Kingsbourne
OL,12,Fdevelopment in Nantwich, Cheshire,
OL,13,Ffaced hold-ups because of legal and
OL,14,Fplanning issues, as well as rising
OL,15,Fcosts.
OL,17,FThe school will eventually be for 210
OL,18,Fpupils but is starting with an intake
OL,19,Fof reception age children, with a new
OL,20,Fcohort joining each year.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
