OL,3,GNEWSANew primary school opens after
OL,4,Alengthy delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FNineteen pupils start on Monday and
OL,7,FSally Burns, head of the school, said:
OL,8,F"For some of them they've watched for
OL,9,Fnearly two years as this building
OL,10,Fstarted."
